  "notes": "Default provider is mock. Install ONNX weights separately with scripts/download_models.py; normal startup does not download them. Once installed, the local classifier runs offline on CPU. Runtime data, private reports, photographs and optional DeepSeek/Ollama installations are excluded from the source archive."
